    "desktop: Conversation shows real persisted messages with bounded20/3 paging.",
    "desktop: Dirty composer survives Task tabs/theme changes and rejected navigation; none of those actions writes or calls a model.",
    "desktop: Save persists one stable request ID and clears its taskSend marker without preview/prepare/Run side effects.",
    "desktop: Explicit preview and resource review lead to exact prepare/execute with fresh consent; linked Run stays in Task Agent work.",
    "prepare-response-loss: Lost preparation response reconciles without auto-execution; reload keeps the prepared lock, immutable resources and unchecked consent until explicit reopen/start.",
    "execute-response-loss: Lost applied execute response reconciles through exact Turn GET only; a failed receipt read preserves the lock and no duplicate Run appears.",
    "saved-response-loss: Uncertain saved message survives reload through taskSend and exact request receipt GET; no automatic or duplicate POST occurs.",
    "unsaved-response-loss: Failed receipt reads keep the original save locked; authoritative404 alone enables an explicit retry of the identical message/request ID.",
    "reload-missing-save-receipt: A reload404 without the original in-memory save candidate keeps its request marker and mutation lock; it cannot invent text or unlock a new request.",
    "changed-prepare-request_id: A schema-valid prepare receipt with changed request_id fails immutable message identity validation before execute and preserves the uncertain lock.",
    "changed-prepare-content: A schema-valid prepare receipt with changed content fails immutable message identity validation before execute and preserves the uncertain lock.",
    "changed-prepare-created_at: A schema-valid prepare receipt with changed created_at fails immutable message identity validation before execute and preserves the uncertain lock.",
    "changed-prepare-reconcile-config: An unknown prepare GET with changed config cannot replace its pending exact candidate or unlock execution; the matching receipt restores review without auto-execution.",
    "changed-prepare-reconcile-context_hash: An unknown prepare GET with changed context_hash cannot replace its pending exact candidate or unlock execution; the matching receipt restores review without auto-execution.",
    "read-boundaries: An independently hydrated off-page prepared Turn remains visible as the21st bounded DTO and locks Arrange; its page overlap renders one consistent message.",
    "read-boundaries: Capabilityfalse performs no Turn reads; advertised403/404/503/malformed pages hide old content and pause Arrange without Bootstrap fallback.",
    "read-boundaries: An obsolete held Task conversation response cannot overwrite the next Task or expose its message controls.",
    "read-boundaries: 401 removes the private conversation and returns to authentication without mutations or replay.",
